    "created_at": "2024-08-05T22:49:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-08-05T22:49:04Z",
    "body": "It's unchecked by definition, because [that's how the `checked` attribute is defined](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#attr-input-checked). An implementation could not treat \"no `checked` attribute\" as checked without violating the spec and making the entire internet's checkboxes broken. That default cannot ever change.",
